# Raw product photography — 76MB of phone photos. Never committed; it stays on
# this machine only. The processed webp output in public/images/user IS
# committed, because that is what the site serves and Vercel builds from a
# clone with no access to your disk.
public/images/productimgs/

.label-progress.json
